Davros document preview converters

docxide-pdf 0.17.1: Apache-2.0 (locally modified)
https://github.com/sverrejb/docxide-pdf
Changes restrict font discovery and substitute the three Liberation families.

office_oxide 0.1.13: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (locally modified)
https://github.com/yfedoseev/office_oxide
Changes preserve explicit XLS column widths and row heights (including blank
rows), cell types, and number formats through OOXML conversion; recover DOC
pictures stored in WordDocument and validate image-record scanning; preserve
explicit DOC page breaks; pair automatic DOC footnote/endnote references with
their bodies and write automatic note-body marks in DOCX; classify DOC comments
correctly; avoid inferred headings for structured DOC paragraphs; preserve natural
PNG proportions for fallback legacy images; and avoid invented PPT slide titles.

libreoffice-rs: MIT; lo_impress also includes Apache-2.0 and MPL-2.0 material
https://github.com/clark-labs-inc/libreoffice-rs
Davros fork: https://github.com/mnutt/libreoffice-rs (16532b3f0ded4b2e05296d114e2eacd91827ed23)
Branch: davros-fixes
lo_impress preset geometry derives from Apache POI (Apache-2.0); its hatch
mapping derives from LibreOffice (MPL-2.0). Corresponding license texts, notices,
provenance, and the MPL-covered hatch source are included under licenses/.
The fork ignores foreign-namespace XLSX sheet elements; no local patch is applied.
Used for XLS/XLSX, PPT/PPTX, ODT, ODS and ODP previews. Changes preserve ODF styles, page
geometry, tables, cached cell formats, headers/footers, images and transparency,
charts, master artwork, lists and simple transforms; add bounded SVG rendering;
use the bundled font directory for Unicode PDF text; interpret bounded enhanced
shape geometry; and improve presentation text inheritance, font metrics and
alignment. PATCHES.md and the
corpus guide describe the logical changes, regression coverage and limitations.

Liberation Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1
https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts

Noto Sans Regular: SIL Open Font License 1.1
https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic
Bundled as a Unicode fallback, including triangular bullet U+2023.

The complete dependency versions are recorded in Cargo.lock.
